{"game": "elden-ring-nightreign", "language": "english", "appid": 2622380, "month": "2026-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1789516800, "end_date": 1790121599, "month_true_total": 635, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-04 23:48:10 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "235867989", "author": {"steamid": "76561199738109063", "personaname": "Fleurs", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199738109063/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1811, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 540, "playtime_at_review": 1273, "last_played": 1790292414, "avatar": "fd85f4cd2ea4ce16ccb8d0361adb57b8310e49d4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Ts is a masterpiece sent down from Miyazaki himself blessing me with the opportunity of simulating how it feels to have my balls crushed repeatedly by a gorilla as it smashes a rock against my skull. 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1790120343, "timestamp_updated": 1790120343, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "235866389", "author": {"steamid": "76561199134893109", "personaname": "Newfield", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199134893109/", "num_games_owned": 88, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 4842, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4842, "last_played": 1786647538, "avatar": "6b4d4649dfc59ed6a4c8a6d3faee87ceeee31afc"}, "language": "english", "review": "[h1] Although I will never be a fan of Nightreign or Elden ring in general [/h1]\nI will still give the game a positive review. This is because the game was geniuenly memorable. I have defeated all base forms of the 'nightlords' (big bosses) with my friends and they were all spectacles with unique moves. The game is epic and there is definetly much fun to be had in nightreign.\n\n I love the difficulty too and i am not scared by a bit of challenge, ive completed games like Hollowknight Silksong and a few monster hunter titles, so i wont stray away from this either.\n\nWhat makes the game somewhat unenjoyable for me is that it is hard to have fun playing solo or with randoms. What makes this game fun for me is playing with friends.\n\nAfter a while the game will feel repetitive like most games, this one just really grinds my gears with the repetitiveness, as you usually run the same strategies for farming points to level up your character ingame, then fight the same couple bosses until you complete the chosen nightlord. \n\nAnother gripe i had was the movement of the character, yes it is beloved by many players but i despise the slow combat system. Your character feels like a schoolbus when turning, and something just feels off. Maybe this is because i dont own a controller for the game, but i like similair and faster combat systems from games like monster hunter that also use the dodge roll mechanic. Nightreign just feels sluggish in my honest opinion, but maybe its a patience / skill issue.", "timestamp_created": 1790118377, "timestamp_updated": 1790118851, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "235865481", "author": {"steamid": "76561199022481332", "personaname": "Sotepote", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199022481332/", "num_games_owned": 99, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 3708, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2406, "playtime_at_review": 2963, "last_played": 1791157358, "avatar": "3709c6cc1e